["ga", "Canis lupus", "Vulpes vulpes"], "raven>wolf": ["ga", "Canis lupus", "Corvus corax"]}, "story": "Isle Royale National Park in Michigan is the largest natural island in Lake Superior, 45 miles long and 9 wide, with more than 400 small islands around it. Its topsoil is thin, which favors trees with shallow, spreading roots such as balsam fir, white spruce and black spruce.", "matters": "It is the fifth-largest lake island in the world. It became a wilderness area in 1976 and a UNESCO Biosphere Reserve in 1980."}